WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.600
Hey! Quick favour.

00:01.600 --> 00:05.600
I'm building a way for anyone to have their own app, just like this one.

00:05.600 --> 00:07.200
Can you help me test it?

00:07.200 --> 00:11.400
Tap Continue with Google, and I'll send you one notification a week.

00:11.400 --> 00:13.800
That's it. See you next week!
